{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story and background:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Exia, a test subject of the School of Bio-Engineering of Cyan College, who gained special power through the mysterious [serum]. In order to escape from the college under lockdown and save as many survivers as possible, she must fight her way through this cruel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything comes with a price. Defeat enemies, talk to NPCs, explore areas, and finally uncover the truth of [serum] that, claimed by the scientists of Cyan College, could end pain, disease and sadness of all mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/AboutThisGameGIF2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750054627\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hack and Slash + Souls-Like Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deflect, slash, dodge, skills, use your moveset wisely to defeat various challenging foes. Build your own playstyle as you acquire more unique weapons, items and abilities along the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/AboutThisGameGIF3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750054627\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Non-linear world and handcrafted levels:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unearth the conspiracy behind the outbreak as you venture through a nonlinear world set in a biohazard background. Fight against mutated creatures and malfunctioned androids that used to protect the Cyan College. Search for the remedy that could save the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/AboutThisGameGIF1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750054627\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[h5][/h5]</p>","backgroun